  "id": "incongruity",
  "term": "incongruity",
  "definition": "Incongruity is a sensed lack of fit or mismatch within experience, even when a person cannot clearly identify what is out of accord. In this historical source, such a vague awareness of incongruity is described as part of the general feeling of congruity or its opposite.",
